1. What each construct evaluates to
  if … else              &str         "small"
  match                  &str         "odd"
  for                    ()           ()
  while                  ()           ()
  loop + break value     i32          30
  labelled block         i32          12
  (the for loop added up to 28; the while loop counted to 3)

2. How far each way out jumps
  continue        next pass          kept the evens: [8, 12]
  break           end of this loop   saw before the first r > 6: [3]
  break 'rows     end of outer loop  first a * b == 6: Some((2, 3))
  return          out of the fn      first_even: Some(8)
  ?               out of the fn      total(1, 2, 3): Ok(6)
  ?               out of the fn      total(1, x, 3): Err("\"x\": invalid digit found in string")
